Talos — third-party attribution
===============================

talos/mail.py — the sender-authentication logic (`verify_sender`, the automated-mail
detection) follows the email platform adapter of **Hermes Agent**
(https://github.com/NousResearch, plugins/platforms/email/adapter.py), MIT licensed,
Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research. The reasoning was adopted, not the code: Hermes' adapter
is bound to that project's gateway types. The vulnerability class it defends against is
tracked as GHSA-rxqh-5572-8m77.

